# Sunstar Lightsmith, a 3/3: "Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature and
# draw a card." Per the ruling, spells cast earlier this turn count, Lightsmith's own cast included: on turn 3 Bot1 casts
# Lightsmith (first, nothing triggers: it is not on the battlefield) and Mox Emerald (second): one counter (a 4/4) and one
# card, the Mountain below the Island drawn for the turn. A third spell, Black Lotus, is a negative control: still one counter.

